# Hi-Tech uPVC Profile Industries — Core Rules

- Brand: **Hi-Tech uPVC Profile Industries** (from `data/company.json` → `companyName`; short form "Hi-Tech uPVC"). Render the logo with `components/ui/BrandLogo.tsx`
- Read `docs/README.md`, `docs/TRACKING.md`, and the relevant page/component doc before coding
- Minimal diffs — only change what the task requires
- No dark mode — light/warm-neutral palette only (ADR 005)
- Server components by default; `"use client"` only for motion/interactivity
- Use `@/` import alias for components and lib
